{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.poster.avif?t=1770156744\" width=640 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.webm?t=1770156744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.mp4?t=1770156744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluff\u2019n\u2019Roll</strong> is a high-speed precision platformer about a determined fluffball rolling through <strong>80 hand-crafted levels across 5 colorful worlds</strong>. You tilt the entire stage to move (no fake slopes or scripted tricks) just <strong>real physics and real level rotation</strong>, letting you pull off skips, angle tech, momentum tricks, and wild saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge hazards, bounce off slopes, squeeze through tight paths, and push your control to the limit. Grab coins, unlock new fluffball looks, and take on brutal challenge levels built for players who enjoy mastering hard games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80 fast, technical levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 worlds</strong>, each with their own mechanics and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real level rotation</strong> that creates deep movement tech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable customization</strong> and fluffball styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAZY physics</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storep